{title: Make A Joyful Noise}
{artist: Larry Holder}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
Lift your voice and let us sing His praise,
And make a joyful noise.
Glorify the Lord in all our ways,
With songs of our thanksgiving!

Verse 2
Glory be to the Father,
And to His Son;
Glory unto the Spirit
In whom believers now are one!

Verse 3
Sing to Him our praises;
Give Him praise in all that we do.
He's our Rock and Salvation:
In Him we know that we are born anew!

Verse 4
(7-measure instrumental, then repeat lyrics)
